      "shortDescription": "CEIA designs and manufactures electromagnetic inspection and induction-heating systems. Its official portfolio covers security, industrial, pharmaceutical, healthcare and ground-search metal detection plus generators, controllers, heating heads and induction coils.",
      "fullDescription": [
        "Official manufacturer sources identify Costruzioni Elettroniche Industriali Automatismi S.p.A. as an Italian engineering and manufacturing company based in Viciomaggio, Arezzo. CEIA performs research, engineering and production for electromagnetic inspection and induction-heating equipment in-house.",
        "The documented range includes walk-through, handheld, industrial and pharmaceutical metal detectors, ferromagnetic and ground-search detectors, cargo and mail inspection systems, networked detection controls and anti-collision telemeters. CEIA also manufactures induction-heating generators, control units, heating heads, coils and accessories for brazing, soldering, heat treatment, forming, curing, cap sealing and shrink fitting."
